2. Run the quantum A/B (`MXFS_SET_PARAMS='ag_yield_quantum=8192'` profile, 16 nodes) vs the 6928ms baseline.
3. If quantum helps: consider making eager drain async/backgrounded in `mxfs_ag_dlm_unlock` (code fix + rev version).
